  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "えものの　こんせきを　みつけると\nねばりづよく　そのばに　はりこむが\nひぐれには　うつらうつら　している。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "먹이의 흔적을 찾으면\n끈질기게 그 자리에 잠복하지만\n날이 저물면 꾸벅꾸벅 존다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "找到獵物的蹤跡後，\n就會堅持蹲守在那個地方，\n但到了傍晚就會昏昏欲睡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Lorsqu’il est sur les traces d’une proie,\nce Pokémon n’est pas du genre à abandonner.\nSauf le soir, lorsqu’il tombe de sommeil.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Findet es Spuren potenzieller Beute, legt\nes sich sofort auf die Lauer. Spätestens\nbei Sonnenuntergang nickt es aber ein.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al detectar el rastro de una presa, la acecha\ncon tenacidad, pero al ponerse el sol le vence\nel sueño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Scovate le tracce della preda, rimane di guardia\nsul posto senza battere ciglio fino al calare\ndel sole, poi cede alla stanchezza.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "When it finds a trace of its prey, it patiently\nstakes out the location...but it’s always snoozing\nby nightfall.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "獲物の　痕跡を　みつけると\n粘り強く　その場に　張り込むが\n日暮れには　うつらうつら　している。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "找到猎物的踪迹后，\n就会坚持蹲守在那个地方，\n但到了傍晚就会昏昏欲睡。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Al detectar el rastro de una presa, la acecha\ncon tenacidad, pero al ponerse el sol le vence\nel sueño.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/27/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "コラッタや　ラッタが　こうぶつなのに\nちゅうこうせいのため　であえない。\nにんたいづよさが　じまんの　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "꼬렛과 레트라를 좋아하지만\n주행성이라 마주치지 못한다.\n강한 인내력이 자랑인 포켓몬이다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜歡吃小拉達和拉達，\n但因為是晝行性而沒機會遇到。\n是以忍耐力強而自豪的寶可夢。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il est accro au goût des Rattata et Rattatac,\nmais n’en croise pas beaucoup car ceux-ci sont\nnocturnes. Heureusement, il sait rester patient.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Rattfratz und Rattikarl sind seine Leibspeise,\naber leider nachtaktiv und daher selten auf\ndem Speiseplan. Ein sehr geduldiges Pokémon.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus presas favoritas son los Rattata y Raticate,\npero, al ser estos diurnos, rara vez se cruza con\nellos. La perseverancia es su gran virtud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È ghiotto di Rattata e Raticate, ma poiché\nè un Pokémon diurno, non ne incontra molti.\nLa perseveranza è la sua dote di spicco.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It adores having Rattata and Raticate for dinner,\nbut as it’s diurnal, it never encounters them.\nThis Pokémon boasts incredible patience.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "コラッタや　ラッタが　好物なのに\n昼行性のため　出会えない。\n忍耐強さが　自慢の　ポケモン。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "喜欢吃小拉达和拉达，\n但因为昼行性而无法遇到。\n是以忍耐力强而自豪的宝可梦。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Sus presas favoritas son los Rattata y Raticate,\npero, al ser estos diurnos, rara vez se cruza con\nellos. La perseverancia es su gran virtud.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/28/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "もともと　アローラには　いなかったが\nむかし　コラッタが　たいりょうに\nはっせいしたときに　つれてこられた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "원래 알로라에 없었지만,\n옛날 꼬렛이 대량으로\n발생했을 때 데려왔다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "原本沒有棲息在阿羅拉，\n是在過去小拉達大量繁殖的時候\n被人們帶過來的。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "À l’origine, on ne le trouvait pas à Alola,\nmais il y a été introduit il y a bien longtemps\npour faire face à la prolifération de Rattata.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon lebte ursprünglich nicht in Alola\nund wurde vor langer Zeit eingeführt, als es eine\nÜberpopulation von Rattfratz in der Region gab.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No es autóctono de Alola, sino que se introdujo\npara paliar la superpoblación de Rattata que se\nprodujo en el pasado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "È stato introdotto ad Alola in passato per\nfare fronte alla sovrappopolazione di Rattata.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Although it wasn’t originally found in Alola, this\nPokémon was brought over a long time ago\nwhen there was a huge Rattata outbreak.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "もともと　アローラには　いなかったが\n昔　コラッタが　大量に\n発生したときに　連れて来られた。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "原本在阿罗拉是没有的，\n但过去小拉达大量出现的时候\n被带了过来。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "No es autóctono de Alola, sino que se introdujo\npara paliar la superpoblación de Rattata que se\nprodujo en el pasado.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es-419",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/14/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-sun",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/29/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "とても　がまんづよい　せいしつだが\nこうぶつの　コラッタを　みつけると\nわれを　わすれて　とびかかるぞ。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "매우 인내심이 강한 성질이지만\n좋아하는 꼬렛을 발견하면\n이성을 잃고 덤벼든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "忍耐力非常強，然而只要\n看見自己愛吃的小拉達，\n就會立刻忘我地撲上去。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "D’un naturel très patient, il ne peut toutefois\ns’empêcher de bondir sur son plat favori,\nRattata, s’il en voit un.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Dieses Pokémon ist eigentlich sehr geduldig.\nSieht es jedoch ein Rattfratz, seine Leibspeise,\nstürzt es sich völlig außer Kontrolle auf es.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "ultra-moon",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/30/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Tiene un carácter muy paciente, pero en cuanto\navista un Rattata, su manjar predilecto, pierde\nel control y se lanza sobre él como un poseso.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
